  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Agricultural Development: Euphrates River Watershed Rehabilitation Project (Firat Nehri Havzasi Rehabilitasyon Projesi - FIRAT)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FIRAT&#xbf;s goal is to reduce poverty in the upland communities in the targeted microcatchment areas of the Euphrates River watershed. The project development objective is to increase the income and resilience of small-scale producers and vulnerable groups, including women and youth, in the targeted microcatchments.</narrative>
  </description>
